OL,3,GNEWSAThick fog disrupts morning travel
OL,4,Aas yellow weather warnings in effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued a further
OL,7,Fwarning for fog from Monday evening
OL,8,Finto Tuesday morning.
